WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.360
Ever hear of personality rehabilitation?

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.290
This nation has secrets
I know nothing about.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.120
Watch your back.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.580
This nation...

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.630
...wants you...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.720
What is going on?
Did my father know about this?

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.880
And my brother, too?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.350
I want to know the truth.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:41.230
This was a declaration of war
by Karen and Seiran.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.980
That's why they withdrew.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:48.030
So they're behind Chairman Sumeragi's
assassination, too?

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:51.360
Yes, Karen and Seiran
most likely ordered it.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.660
I heard nearly half of our troops
defected to Seiran.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:01:00.370
That's right. The OSF must regroup
with what troops are left.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.750
I want you guys to serve on
the newly formed 01 Platoon.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.920
And you will serve
as their commander, Yuito.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.220
Me? Commander?

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.930
As I already told you,
I need you to become a hero.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:17.100
You will protect New Himuka.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.370
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:38.660
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.580
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.000
<i>And disappears</i>

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.080
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.630
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:48.710
<i>I get sick</i>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.630
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.050
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.010
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:02.730
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.810
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:10.570
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.780
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.240
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:25.080
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.670
<i>We will fly</i>

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:29.500
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:34.340
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.760
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.610
Yuito?

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.160
What's wrong? Why'd you stop?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.530
Huh? Oh, uh...

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:05.490
The Hunt for Nagi

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.660
Are you okay?

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.250
Weren't we just at HQ?

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.750
What?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:09.000
What are you talking about?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.590
Sorry for the wait.

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:16.300
I had them impose a media blackout
to keep the Crows away.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.720
Luka? I mean, sir?

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:21.680
I already told you there's no
need to stand on ceremony.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.980
Especially now that you're
platoon commander.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.810
Wait. I'm a commander?

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.730
I don't understand.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:30.940
Yuito?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.190
Yuito's acting strange.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:37.570
Wataru, are there any abnormalities
in Yuito's brain data?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.660
No, nothing of note.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:44.120
We've been reorganized
into 01 Platoon, OSF.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:48.830
You're our newly appointed commander,
and we're currently on patrol duty.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:54.960
I remember being summoned
by my brother, and then...

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.670
I can't remember anything else.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:02.510
I don't even recall whether I asked
Kaito about our nation's secrets.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.640
You really don't remember?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.600
No, I don't.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.440
I've a bad feeling about this.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:13.400
You should have OSF Hospital
look into it as soon as you can.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.230
I'll report to the top brass
if it looks bad.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.200
My uncle is director general
of OSF Hospital.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.780
I'll show you around.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:26.040
I could get in touch with him and
have you cut to the front of the line.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.290
Leave the patrolling to us.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.790
You're our commander.
I can't force you to do anything, but...

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.510
You should have them take a look,
don't you think, Yuito?

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:49.730
Now I will announce how
the Seiran OSF will be organized.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:51.480
01 Platoon.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:55.020
Kyoka Eden, Arashi Spring,

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:58.490
Kagero Donne, Shiden Ritter,

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:00.490
and Haruka Frazer.

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.110
Their commander is

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.200
Kasane Randall.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:11.000
Creating a surveillance society
wasn't enough for New Himuka.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.920
They've also conducted forbidden research.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:17.000
Research on turning people into Others.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:21.090
They studied how to forge
exceptional psionics users,

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:26.010
and in the process, they conducted tests
on the metamorphosis of life forms.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:30.310
I will crush the New Himukan regime
and their hellish research.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:33.230
You should join us in Seiran, too.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:37.070
The New Himukan regime
turned Naomi into an Other?

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.610
That's right.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:43.110
So then Naomi is in Seiran?
You're going to help her?

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.280
I'll do all in my power.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.830
Okay, then.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.500
I, too, will go to Seiran.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:59.250
I never expected that all of you
would side with Seiran.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.300
Well, I was born in Seiran.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:06.930
The way the New Himukan regime
operates never grew on me.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.350
They're mercurial.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:15.730
To think you'd be joining us, Kyoka.
Don't tell me you're a fan of Karen's?

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:20.530
Oh my, is there something wrong with
being a fan of the Major General's?

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:23.070
Wait, seriously?!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.990
Just kidding.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:29.950
In a position like mine, you notice
questionable government moves,

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.540
even if you'd rather not.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:36.790
I can't believe they're studying how
to transform humans into Others.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.540
It's unforgivable.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:44.510
It seems everyone who came over to
Seiran's side mistrusts the government.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:48.220
But Major General Karen's magnetism
also exerts its own pull.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.680
Hey, where's Kasane?

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:56.560
Who knows? I haven't seen her
since the meeting ended.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.280
My sister is somewhere in this city.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.620
No Connection

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.960
The hero who assassinated
Chairman Sumeragi is here.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.050
The higher-ups here in Seiran
are delighted.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.720
It wasn't me.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:30.680
You got a problem with being a hero?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.220
Use it to your advantage.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.390
It's Seiran that wants to use me.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:39.190
But enough about that. Where is Naomi?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:48.570
A micro-local gravity anomaly is occurring
in the sky above Kunad Highway.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.200
It's growing?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:55.370
Yes, it's slowly growing as it
consumes everything around it.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:08:00.920
The New Himukan government
has dubbed it the Kunad Gate.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.960
Meanwhile, it began to grow.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.590
The quasi-black hole we created back then,

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.220
the Kunad Gate.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:19.310
Do you deny seeing it when it had grown
large enough to consume the world?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.810
I knew it.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.570
Kasane, you traveled to the future,
didn't you?

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:26.650
What?

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.450
Don't waste my time.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:34.370
Just tell me what happened in the future.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:37.910
So he knows I've been to the future.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:41.170
No point hiding it now.

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:44.670
I met you as the world
was coming to an end.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.340
What did the future me say?

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.340
I'll finally have some help.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.180
I see.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:56.720
Did you mean help for saving
those turned into Others?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.810
What do you know
that you're not telling me?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:04.980
If you know how to cure them,
then you can save Naomi, can't you?

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:09.610
All I can tell you is research
on the Others is underway

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.820
at a facility here in Seiran.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.780
And Naomi is there, isn't she?!

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.950
Yes, under our protection.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.950
Where?! Tell me where the facility is!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.410
I can't do that.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:25.710
Civilians are strictly prohibited due to
the top-secret research conducted there.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.710
I'm not a civilian.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.170
I'll make you tell me if I have to.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.340
There you are.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.220
Arashi?!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.140
Sorry to interrupt, but duty calls.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.310
And we'd be lost without our commander.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:46.150
Arashi, keep a tight rein
on this wild horse.

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.730
Why'd you interrupt?!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:54.410
You don't think straight
when it comes to Naomi.

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.370
I heard what you said.
You want to go to the research facility.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:01.120
If that's the case, stop making waves.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.160
Meaning what?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:08.000
The best way to defy authority
is to pretend to play their game.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.550
You'll help me find Naomi?

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:16.140
Of course. It may not seem like it,
but I consider her a comrade.

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.430
I'll collect intel on the facility.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.770
In the meantime, let's just do our duty.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.520
It's nothing serious.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:30.280
You have nothing to worry about.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:32.780
I'll write you a prescription.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.240
Take it at the first sign of symptoms.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.530
O-Okay, Doctor.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.620
Thank you.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:49.170
Yuito! How'd it go?

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.380
My body and mind are exhausted.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.880
It's causing an oversecretion
of psionic hormone,

00:10:54.880 --> 00:11:00.970
which in turn causes temporary confusion
in the brain's memory region.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:04.850
But that's it. The doctor says
I'll be fine if I take my meds.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.110
Oh, okay. That's a relief.

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:11.900
Yeah, it is, but...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.230
"Muscle Dance"

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.290
I'm glad it was nothing serious, Yuito.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:29.000
I don't get what young women
like these days.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.590
A lot's happened since you were inducted.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.960
You must be exhausted.

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.390
It looks kinda wilted.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:41.010
It needs more water.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.100
What's everyone doing here?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:52.520
Don't worry.
We're all done with patrol duty.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.780
Tsugumi kept saying how worried she was.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:04.790
Yuito, you need plenty of water, too.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:08.080
Don't overdo it just because
you're a commander now.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.420
If we can do anything to help,

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.380
just say the word.

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:16.420
I really appreciate it, you guys.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.220
Here's the hero who defeated the Others

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:23.390
and saved Suoh during the Suoh Incident,
Private Yuito Sumeragi.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:27.810
His distinguished service earned him
a promotion to 2nd lieutenant.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.230
And he's been named
commander of 01 Platoon.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:36.690
What? When did that happen?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.240
I've no memory of it.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:43.700
Now, let's take a look at
Lieutenant Sumeragi's heroic efforts.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.460
Yuito, you may not like this,
but you must grin and bear it.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:52.880
You will be held up as the hero
who saves this nation.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:57.130
The chairman's death has plunged
the nation into chaos.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:00.760
You will give the people hope.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.010
Wait, I do remember something like that.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.890
But what about the rest?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:09.810
It's no use! I can't remember!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.150
The knife-wielding traitor,
Kasane Randall,

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.730
assassinated Chairman Joe Sumeragi.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:19.280
But his son, Lieutenant Yuito Sumeragi,

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:23.030
has overcome this tragedy to bravely
make a stand for New Himuka.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:29.410
Hey, since we're here,
you want a tour of the hospital?

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.080
I'll show you around!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:31.660
Huh?

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.830
Sounds good.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:37.960
Yeah, it's better than watching
the Crows spew all that propaganda.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.090
No objection here.

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.180
It'll be a while until your
prescription is filled.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.350
Okay, let's do the tour.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.860
One second.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.150
Can I help you with something?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.700
Oh, yes. How do I get to
the Neurology Department?

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.830
Oh, um, just follow that indicator,
and you'll be fine.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.500
I'm sorry, but I can't see it.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.170
You see, I'm a dud.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.630
I can't use systems
that employ psionic power.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.590
I'll take you there.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.220
Sorry. I'll be back soon.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.350
Okay.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.220
This way.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.810
Thank you.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:34.390
The city's Visions, Psynet,
and all the other systems

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:38.320
were created for people
with psionic power.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:42.990
I heard that 0.1% of
the population are duds.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:48.200
The government should be
more attentive to their needs.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.990
It's right there.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.620
Thanks for the help.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.790
My pleasure.

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.210
Take care.

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:06.760
Nagi?

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.360
Nagi's here?!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.820
They took an elevator to the sublevel.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.910
Maybe it wasn't him.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.870
Sorry. I can't get a fix on him.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:37.080
Hospital access is restricted.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.270
It's him.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:55.230
Nagi.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.850
The sublevel tunnel.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.270
They put him in a van...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.230
...and drove off.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.280
The sublevel tunnel leads out of the city.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.780
Where are they headed?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.120
Hang on.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.900
South Suoh

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:11.900
Old Lokusho City

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.910
In the direction of Lokusho City,
most likely.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.040
Lokusho City?

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.960
The Others destroyed the city
in a massive attack 11 years ago.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:26.130
Was that when you and your mother...

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:31.930
OSF Hospital used to be
in Lokusho City, right?

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.510
Um, yeah.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.680
It should have been abandoned years ago.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.100
Yes, it should have.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:42.020
But if it really was Nagi...

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.820
If Nagi is still alive,
I'd like to see him again.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.950
I want you all to come with me!

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.790
That's the former OSF Hospital.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.250
There's nothing left around it.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.500
Others seek human brains.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.340
They don't flatten whole cities.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:24.650
I found the van,
but there's no sign of Nagi.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.820
What's inside there?

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.490
I can't see into many areas.

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:36.450
So, it really is still in use.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.870
Why do you say that?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:44.750
Rumor has it there's a facility at
the old hospital that's still operational.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.170
The New Himukan government may have
leveled the surrounding buildings.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:53.340
Wataru, can you tell us
anything about what's inside?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.890
I can't access any data
about the old hospital.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.640
That makes support difficult. Be careful.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.810
Got it.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.730
Okay, people, keep an eye out.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.410
That thing's scary.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:20.370
It's sucking up everything around it.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.710
I wonder what happens
once you get inside there.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.380
Hey, Shiden. Why don't you
try sticking a finger in?

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:30.960
If you want to stick something in,
try your head.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:34.550
Enough. Don't even joke
about getting near that thing.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.390
Remember, curiosity killed the cat.

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:40.560
I can feel it.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:46.560
It's like the feeling I get when the power
of the Red Strings is at work.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.400
That means...

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:53.990
Our psionic power is gravikinesis,
and we both use a similar form.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:58.950
Our powers resonated with each other,
creating the Kunad Gate.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.950
What Yuito said in the future was true.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.080
What are you thinking about?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:10.050
I think I know. You're remembering
seeing that thing in the future.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:13.050
You know, the future where you met Yuito.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.800
It was like he was a different person.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.890
A grief-stricken old man
eager to sacrifice himself.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.020
So you're trying to kill Yuito
before it comes to that?

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:26.560
Before Yuito starts suffering?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.160
That day I was here with my mother...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.330
You must live.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.710
And now that person...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.720
What is it?

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:56.970
Intruders?

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:58.930
How is that possible?!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.230
What is it, Yuito?

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.480
Huh?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.200
Were you thinking about
your time in the hospital?

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.990
No, I guess I was just too young.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.700
I actually don't remember much
from back then.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.920
Look out! Above us!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.970
Yuito!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.760
Thanks!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.640
I was only watching our front and rear.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.940
Forgive me.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.020
Thanks, Hanabi!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.820
No worries. But it's not over.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:55.030
Here it comes.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:27.060
The readings are intensifying?!

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:28.850
The gravity anomaly is growing!

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.310
Why all of a sudden?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.770
I've no idea.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.530
The Kunad Gate's growth rate
just increased by 5%.

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:19.610
Nagi!

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:11.970
The Hospital's Secrets
